## 📊 Static Analysis (Feedback Computacional Base)

### TypeScript - Type Safety Sensor

```bash
# Check pré-commit
npx tsc --noEmit

# Check strict
npx tsc --noEmit --strict
```

### ESLint - Code Quality Sensor

```bash
# Check completo
yarn lint
```

